# HTML Pages

## Script load order (required)
```html
<script src="data/products.js"></script>   <!-- or ../data/products.js in categories/ -->
<script src="js/icons.js"></script>        <!-- or ../js/icons.js -->
<script src="js/main.js"></script>
```

## Root vs category paths
| Location | CSS | Scripts |
|----------|-----|---------|
| Root (`index.html`, `about.html`, `contact.html`) | `css/styles.css` | `data/`, `js/` |
| `categories/*.html` | `../css/styles.css` | `../data/`, `../js/` |

## Body data attributes
```html
<!-- Home -->
<body data-page="home">

<!-- About / Contact -->
<body data-page="about">
<body data-page="contact">

<!-- Category (slug must match data/products.js) -->
<body data-page="category" data-category="drinkware">
```

## Shared shell
Every page includes empty placeholders — do not hardcode header/footer HTML:
```html
<header class="site-header" data-site-header></header>
<footer class="site-footer" data-site-footer></footer>
```

## Category page template
Required hooks for `initCategoryPage()`:
- `[data-category-hero]` — hero banner (image, breadcrumb, title, description injected by JS)
- `[data-sidebar-nav]`, `[data-category-chips]`
- `[data-product-search]`, `[data-product-count]`, `[data-product-grid]`

## Titles and meta
- Format: `{Page or Category} — Gifting Catalogue`
- Meta descriptions should mention Gifting Catalogue and the page topic

## Adding a new category
1. Add entry to `CATEGORIES` in `data/products.js`
2. Add SVG to `CATEGORY_ICONS` in `js/icons.js`
3. Copy an existing `categories/*.html` and update `data-category`, title, meta
